<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit declines.</title>
<headline>Saudi Cement Co Q1 pre-tax profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   100.0   vs   114.1</p>
<p> Operating income	 136.1   vs   140.8</p>
<p> Net operating income    97.6   vs   110.4</p>
<p> Other income		 4.3   vs     5.6</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  1,980.9   vs 1,948.3</p>
<p> Assets		   2,722.0   vs 2,595.1</p>
<p>Full Name: Saudi Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Dammam-based firm, traded on the Saudi stock market, is one of eight cement firms in Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
